 * Overlay-only: injects a versioned stylesheet into AGC vicidial.php output
 * without editing the stock VICIdial PHP file.
 *
 * Maintenance notes:
 * - This file is deployed on the server as /var/www/html/agc/ui/bootstrap.php.
 * - The stock /agc/vicidial.php remains untouched; .user.ini loads this file.
 * - Most visual styling lives in assets/css/agent-lite.css.
 * - The inline JavaScript is intentionally compact because it is injected into
 *   legacy VICIdial pages that do not have a modern asset pipeline.
 * - The lower Action Board utility buttons are intentionally overlay-owned
 *   for MUTE, WEBPHONE VIEW/HIDE and AGENTS VIEW. Manual Dial, Fast Dial and
 *   View Call Log keep the original VICIdial click handlers.
